{"headword":"קָנָא","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb.denom </strong>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong> be jealous, zealous (</strong>Gerber<sup>131</sup><strong>)</strong>;—Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">קִנֵּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 25:13\" href=\"/Numbers.25.13\">Nu 25:13</a> +; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">קִנֵּאתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 1:14\" href=\"/Zechariah.1.14\">Zc 1:14</a> + etc.; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְקַנֵּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.13\">Is 11:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.17\">Pr 23:17</a>, etc.; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">קַנֹּא</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 19:10\" href=\"/I_Kings.19.10\">1 K 19:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 19:14\" href=\"/I_Kings.19.14\">14</a>; cstr. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קַנְאוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 25:11\" href=\"/Numbers.25.11\">Nu 25:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">קַנֹאתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.2\">2 S 21:2</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְקַנֵּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:29\" href=\"/Numbers.11.29\">Nu 11:29</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>be jealous of</em>, c. acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶת־אִשְׁתּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 5:14\" href=\"/Numbers.5.14\">Nu 5:14</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 5:30\" href=\"/Numbers.5.30\">30</a> (P); in rivalry <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.13\">Is 11:13</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>be envious of</em>, c. ב pers., <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:1\" href=\"/Genesis.30.1\">Gn 30:1</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:11\" href=\"/Genesis.37.11\">37:11</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:1\" href=\"/Psalms.37.1\">ψ 37:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:3\" href=\"/Psalms.73.3\">73:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:31\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.31\">Pr 3:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.17\">23:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.1\">24:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.19\">19</a>; c. acc. pers. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:14\" href=\"/Genesis.26.14\">Gn 26:14</a> (J); <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:9\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.9\">Ez 31:9</a>; c. ל pers. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:16\" href=\"/Psalms.106.16\">ψ 106:16</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>be zealous</em> for:"},{"senses":[{"definition":"of man, c. ל pers. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:29\" href=\"/Numbers.11.29\">Nu 11:29</a> (J); <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.2\">2 S 21:2</a>; for God <a data-ref=\"Numbers 25:13\" href=\"/Numbers.25.13\">Nu 25:13</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"I Kings 19:10\" href=\"/I_Kings.19.10\">1 K 19:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 19:14\" href=\"/I_Kings.19.14\">14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ קנאה</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 25:11\" href=\"/Numbers.25.11\">Nu 25:11</a> (P)."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of God, <span dir=\"rtl\">לְשֵׁם קָדְשִׁי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 39:25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.39.25\">Ez 39:25</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לְאַרְצוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:18\" href=\"/Joel.2.18\">Jo 2:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לִירוּשׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 1:14\" href=\"/Zechariah.1.14\">Zc 1:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לְצִיּוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 8:2\" href=\"/Zechariah.8.2\">Zc 8:2</a><sup>(×2)</sup>"}],"num":"b."}],"num":"3."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>excite to jealous anger</em>, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּ</span> instr. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.21\">Dt 32:21</a> a (dub.; probably <span dir=\"rtl\">הַקְנִאוּנִי</span>; cf. v <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.21\">21</a> b), <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:22\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.22\">1 K 14:22</a>."}],"num":"4."}],"form":"Pi."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>provoke to jealous anger:</em> Impf. 3 mpl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַקְנִאֻהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.16\">Dt 32:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יַקְנִיאוּהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:58\" href=\"/Psalms.78.58\">ψ 78:58</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּכְעִיסוּהוּ</span>); 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַקְנִיאֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.21\">Dt 32:21</a> b; Pt. metapl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַקְנֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.3\">Ez 8:3</a> (Ges<sup>§ 75 q</sup>, del. Co)."}],"form":"Hiph."}]},"rid":"BDB08851","strong_numbers":["7065"],"next_hw":"קַנָּא","prev_hw":"קִנְאָה","all_cited":true,"brackets":"first_word","quotes":[],"GK":["7861"],"TWOT":["2038"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}